  "proof_supplied": [
    "Positive absolute-boundary Hodge identity on a Euclidean4-ball, proved by explicit divergence calculation.",
    "Coefficientwise mean-zero from divergence-free plus zero normal component, hence actual Poincare/Sobolev coercivity.",
    "Nonlinear critical absorption for a GIVEN small-L4 Coulomb potential, with explicit epsilon=(4S)^(-1) and C=2(1+P+S).",
    "Exact four-dimensional scaling of L4 potential, L2 derivative and L2 curvature.",
    "Hilbert weak W1,2 extraction plus Rellich strong L2 and interpolation to every Lp,p<4.",
    "Weak L2 curvature convergence despite only strong L1 convergence of the quadratic term, proved by dense test approximation.",
    "Weak Coulomb/normal condition, weak ordinary ASD closure and preservation of already-given finite equivariance."
  ],
  "smallest_remaining_prerequisite": "Construction of (compatible, in the singular application equivariant) Coulomb gauges from sufficiently small critical L2 curvature, with the needed smallL4 potential. This new helper proves the subsequent coercivity/extraction step and does not assume that construction as a proved supplier.",
  "full_holds_remaining": [
    "Gauge existence and patching from small curvature; removal/bubbling at points and prescribed codimension-two holonomy.",
    "Singular Sobolev/Fredholm slices and regular holonomy perturbations.",
    "Energy-index finiteness, orientations, low-index compactification and broken-trajectory gluing.",
    "Integral cube higher-map/saddle coherence and unlink identification.",
    "Sutured closure/excision/nonvanishing and I-natural/KHI comparison.",
    "PropertyP nonvanishing/ordinary holonomy removal route and the locally-flat meridian-disk smooth-compatiblePL bridge for full Gordon-Luecke."
  ],
